{"title":"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Note\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Note</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\">Problem 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The square of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/0/470e6c30181a3b61ad3227e2e0d5e4689e510880.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5-\\sqrt{y^2-25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" /> is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/6/696aa0559ac39ffd44d1ad5688a2a515db929b0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ y^2-5\\sqrt{y^2-25} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ -y^2 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ y^2 \\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ (5-y)^2\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ y^2-10\\sqrt{y^2-25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"347\" height=\"46\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/5/245d3f01946e3668f2374d30839305ac276a87d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5-\\sqrt{y^2-25})^2 = 5^2-2\\cdot 5\\cdot\\sqrt{y^2-25}+y^2-25 = y^2-10\\sqrt{y^2-25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"547\" height=\"22\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/4/0b48db022b8d4dc7baa4cf52251d04402faf26ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ \\Rightarrow$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"23\" height=\"10\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/e/62effaf0d5dc9bfa1d137bed40c4baa73698962d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Note\">Note</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Note\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Answer choice E is the only one with the coefficient of the radical term being 10.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a 